## AVAudioSession

### Categories

| Category | Use Case | Silent Switch | Background |
|----------|----------|---------------|------------|
| `.ambient` | Game sounds, not primary | Silences | No |
| `.soloAmbient` | Default, interrupts others | Silences | No |
| `.playback` | Music play
